be glorified (to the world by the way we conduct ourselves) forever and ever;
• provide us an honorable livelihood;
• break the yoke of galus from our neck, and may He lead us proudly to our land;
• send abundant blessing into this house and upon this table at which we have eaten;
• send us Eliyahu HaNavi and let him bring us good tidings (about the arrival of Mashiach).
